a6f-3787-4c02-8e35-a721898602d6.pdf","ticker":"NAN"},{"mcap":null},{"mcap":null},{"mcap":null}],"m_and_a":[{"mcap":null},{"mcap":null},{"company":"Rajesh Power Services Ltd","isin":"INE0VN801010","label":"Rajesh Power Services Ltd","mcap":null,"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/ee98eea3-e525-4ca4-b990-39ff3b091c1d.pdf","ticker":"NAN"}],"order_wins":[{"company":"Juniper Green Energy Limited","isin":"INE05C901015","label":"JNPR","mcap":13689.5,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/JGEL2025_15082026122500_2026_08_15_Regulation_30_Disclosure_JGEL_LoA.pdf","ticker":"JNPR"},{"mcap":null},{"company":"DMR Engineering Ltd","isin":"INE07L501010","label":"DMR Engineering Ltd","mcap":null,"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/6cd585ec-0e74-4b19-bbc7-3e0de2c3f8b7.pdf","ticker":"NAN"}],"other_notable":[{"mcap":null},{"mcap":null},{"mcap":null}]},"theme_titles":{"business_updates":"Business updates","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","other_notable":"Other notable"},"themes":{"business_updates":["**Results season, and on a holiday tape it is most of what moved** — **13 companies filed results or earnings-call material**, including **Greenpanel Industries**, **Indraprastha Gas**, **Saatvik Green Energy** and **NMDC Steel**.","**Markolines Pavement Technologies** — June-quarter revenue of **Rs 75.86 crore**, EBITDA up **8.7%** and profit after tax up **15.1% to Rs 4.36 crore**, against a stated order book of **over Rs 550 crore**.","**Jinkushal Industries** — standalone June-quarter revenue up **37.4% to Rs 5,129.42 lakh** and consolidated revenue up **15.9% to Rs 5,656.55 lakh**, which the company attributes to inventory positioning and wider international presence.","**Ritco Logistics** — reports a June quarter delivered *despite* Middle East disruption to its petrochemical customers, with PSU plants shut or at half capacity, and says it retained its **CRISIL A-** rating.","**M M Forgings** — clarifies that the **Rs 56.25 crore exceptional item, net of tax**, in its June-quarter results is **profit on the sale of land near Oragadam, Chennai** during the quarter, not an operating gain _(~2.0% of mcap)_."],"capex_core":["**Sanginita Chemicals — the day's largest number, on a company worth Rs 326 crore.** Its wholly owned Agastya Green Energy announced a **Rs 7,800 crore, 12 GW ingot and wafer plant at Kurnool** _(~2,394% of mcap)_, with no financing disclosed."],"distress_risk":["**Aban Offshore** — the auditors issue a **disclaimer of opinion**, unable to obtain bank confirmations for **Rs 59.30 crore of deposits and Rs 414.80 crore of term borrowings** at 31 March 2026, against a market value of Rs 108 crore.","**Eureka Industries** — the NCLT Ahmedabad admitted the company's **own petition under Section 54C** on 14 August, commencing a **pre-packaged insolvency resolution process** with the board remaining in control of the company.","**Sterlite Technologies — a win, not a loss.** The Delhi High Court dismissed the Department of Telecommunications' challenge, upholding the award that quashed a **Rs 8.56 crore** demand, leaving *zero financial or operational exposure*.","**Indian Hume Pipe** — the Commissioner of Income Tax (Appeals) confirmed a **Rs 63.11 lakh penalty** for assessment year 2023-24, levied on alleged unexplained purchases of **Rs 10.52 crore** while the quantum appeal is still pending before the ITAT.","**India Power Corporation** — also convenes the **fourth meeting of its committee of creditors** for 17 August, to note the June-quarter results and the resolution professional's continuing review of a 2025 business transfer agreement."],"m_and_a":["**RPG Life Sciences** — completes the **slump sale of its Active Pharmaceutical Ingredients business to RPG Active Pharma**, a wholly owned subsidiary, with effect from today under the business transfer agreement signed on 29 July.","**RPG Life Sciences** — separately subscribes **Rs 65.69 crore** to that subsidiary's rights issue, 21,89,535 shares allotted on 14 August, after which its holding is **unchanged at 100%**, so no capital enters the group _(~1.4% of mcap)_.","**Rajesh Power Services** — incorporates **Rajesh Power Services NZ**, a 100% wholly owned New Zealand subsidiary for electrical and solar EPC work, with the subscription amount left to the incorporation documents and no consideration stated."],"order_wins":["**Juniper Green Energy** — a letter of award from **SECI for 230 MW of firm and dispatchable round-the-clock renewable capacity** at a tariff of **Rs 5.26 per unit**, to be commissioned within 24 months on a 25-year PPA, with no contract value stated.","**Hazoor Multi Projects also filed the identical rupee figure yesterday** — Rs 28.47 crore for the Thirupapachethi plaza on NH-49 in Tamil Nadu — so two separate NHAI toll-collection awards, in two states, are sized to the same lakh.","**DMR Engineering** — a **revised** intimation correcting yesterday's letter on its **Rs 1.66 crore, eight-year** project-management appointment for the 1,500 MW Tarali pumped storage project, now naming its consortium rather than Adani Renewable Energy One."],"other_notable":["**Ola Electric** — launches a **battery energy storage portfolio**, Ola Shakti for homes, Shakti Rack for commercial and industrial use and Mahashakti for utility scale, built on its own cell and pack capability, with no pricing disclosed.","**Mahindra & Mahindra** — Mahindra Electric introduces the **BE 6 SPORTEQ starting at Rs 11.45 lakh** under a **battery-as-a-service** plan, with the battery charged separately at **Rs 3.75 per kilometre**.","**P N Gadgil Jewellers** opened a **3,500 sq ft** store in Gurugram, which its release calls an entry into Delhi NCR, and **HFCL's** row is a schedule for the Motilal Oswal investor conference on 18 August rather than a press release.